    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208a0a6d0c7ec4492e38047c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了！\r\n上面写了什么呢……\r\n那个，我可以先看看吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5bc3fa1f9d43a02c9e28a3d9576fa7341e4f7d01325af2b6f857d9a51ca871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6edf6f0b3e7a60b16c3bca40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物来了！里面一定\r\n充满了各种美好的心意吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc08c0220567708d54d3a9629687ffb914c3ee515e3ab6416ad62127f22af15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85613e9f9bb65834b6364aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "邦邦咔邦~！任务完成♪",
