      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea69ed43b5af752eea8e832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢。\r\n我已经准备完全了！\r\n要尽情享受喽～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9773e28ce2b91c9c0a3a52dba7d4d796e20f319acc2796391435323b74aec30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0c87898251cf137e18fc61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不想放弃啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e10cb59f7b4015da22492ff9050ff8e246928ce285b7b381f19bf7a654b66f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d414d4cc3d2a258ad266aee0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提高了！\r\n恭喜恭喜~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4bad23e1c59ad9624a29de7ca01211971b5283802f8d4432b8bbafd3cb0acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cba351b27e2065b49adde6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“就是它了”花了半年时间才做出\n这条让我有这种感想的手工项链……\n花了很多心思，也是我最喜欢的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "79ad008428266d31ea43df9c385b784e1d191f8278c70a76815a63a3fd322d16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec74e337f27458b822cbbae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿之前一定要晾一晾。\n让太阳晒到松松软软……\n呵呵呵~真想一直穿着啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd4185b7b9dc17f6775d00fbabd47ebf0725817968b778696d14262dc4073fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c7ca2e9e92b12217409bdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天想拍出一张能让人\n惊呼『没错这才是我！』的照片。\n在此之前需要不断尝试再尝试呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45950bed06e557dc11e97f28f59d07e291dff80ef4810e536a09e3cc0b3517ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5bba67090bc49719f2d8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就差一点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "371b3de85f581d65ee2981558911a8780994ede55a353e65ff461b085ef75c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bc88ac736d15f4f598b719",
